unty&rsquo;s 4 grids, April to May came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 58% of normal in January to February and 63% in August to September. All 4 grids had their driest year in 1963, and grid 23578 got 70% of normal that year.</p>"}
